==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 8 seconds<sup>240f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Swordsman (form 2) (Enemy)|Swordsmen (form 2)]] spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Li'l Gau (form 2) (Enemy)|Li'l Gau (form 2)]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Princess Head]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

